WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.987
This slide focuses on Access values safely Start
with the meaning of the idea then

00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:11.572
connect it to the example and the larger analytical
workflow Square

00:00:11.585 --> 00:00:16.667
brackets work when the key exists The get method is
safer when a key may

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:22.295
be missing Use brackets and get Before running the

00:00:22.321 --> 00:00:27.666
example predict what the output should look like Run
it in the browser inspect the

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:33.679
result then change one input key value or condition
and run it again Focus

00:00:33.706 --> 00:00:35.048
on what changed and why
